            "text_size": "40,15",
            "txt_align": "start",
            "sub_heading": "",
            "heading": "How does it work?",
            "text": "<p>It’s simple: Add three pairs of Ahinsa shoes to your cart and <strong>enter the code RADOST.<\/strong><\/p><p>We’ll <strong>automatically deduct<\/strong> the price of the least expensive pair.<\/p><p>A few more things you should know:<\/p><ul><li>The offer applies to <strong>all Ahinsa shoes<\/strong>. Even sale pairs.<\/li><li>We’ll gladly <strong>exchange the shoes free of charge<\/strong>. <\/li><li><strong>Returning one of the pairs?<\/strong> Unfortunately the free pair no longer applies.<\/li><\/ul>",
            "subhd_color": "#222222",
            "hd_color": "#222222",
            "des_color": "#202020",
